125800 830-GET-CC-DESC.
125900     MOVE VEN-CC TO UM-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE UM-ARG TO VALIDUM OF MVALIDUM-REC.
           READ MVALIDUM   INTO BUF-MVALIDUM
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
126200     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
126300        MOVE SPACES TO V2-CURR
126400     ELSE
